===Sleeping Quarters===
{{Main|Sleeping Quarters}}
Upgrading the Sleeping Quarters increases the maximum number of workers at base camp. Tier 1 Sleeping Quarters has a maximum gathering ability of 900 resources per hour, tier 2 has a maximum of gathering ability of 1,800 resources per hour, and tier 3 has a maximum of gathering ability of 3,600 resources per hour. The Sleeping Quarters is located in the north-western part of the camp, west of the Spa.

