===Spa===
{{Main|Spa (Anachronia base camp)}}
The Spa is run by the [[spa owner]]. It provides the player with boosts to [[Agility]] experience across Anachronia (excluding [[silverhawk boots]]). It also contains a [[spa pool]] that grants effects identical to three of the pools at the [[Spa]] in [[Oo'glog]]. The Spa is located in the northern part of the camp, east of the Sleeping Quarters.

This does not require [[As a First Resort]], but it does not have the Bandos or sulphur pools.

