==Other structures==
Other structures can be found and built across Anachronia, providing various utilities.
===Bait box===
{{Main|Bait box}}
The "pile of planks" is located by the main stairs just east of the lodestone, immediately south of the [[Lectern (Anachronia)|lectern]], or at any [[Big Game Hunter]] location. Once built, all the hotspots across Anachronia turn into [[bait box]]es where bait can be deposited and withdrawn.

{{Bait box tiers}}

===Deposit box===
{{Main|Deposit box (Anachronia, buildable)}}
[[Deposit box (Anachronia, buildable)|Deposit box]]es can be found at the following locations:
* Western: [[Bill (Zygomite)|Bill]] in [[Eggsperimentation]] activity
* North-eastern: [[Observation outpost]]
* South-eastern: [[Xolo City]]
* Central: East of the [[spirit grove]]

Building one at one of these locations only makes that location's deposit box available, and the rest must be built separately.

